==============================================================================
[G0] EXACT: under u->2pi-u the integrand mu(|cos u|)cos u sin u is odd about u=pi
     => closed-loop work = 0 EXACTLY for ANY even mu, at ALL amplitudes (incl deep-MOND). [PROVEN]
[G1] closed-loop work  oint F_in dq  (full nonlinear mu_fw, adaptive quad, NOT linearized):
     A=1e+00 w=1e+00  x_peak=1.00e+00 [transition            ]  W_loop=-8.92e-17 (quaderr 1.0e-14)
